<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Database>
    <EnglishText>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>The Path of Duty</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The voices of the {1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} people echo with hope for the future; Yi Sun-sin knows he must ensure their good fortune. The coasts are bountiful yet vulnerable. Duty demands a plan for defense.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>The Path of Duty</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270B_NAME">
            <Text>Build a fleet to safeguard the shore.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Free Promotion on current Fleet Commanders.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>{1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} ships ensure the safety of the people.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Have 4 Naval Units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270C_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>The Path of Duty</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270C_NAME">
            <Text>Study the strategies of the great masters.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} in all Settlements.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270C_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The art of war requires a ready mind.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270C_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Build a Library and Research 2 Technology Masteries.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270D_NAME">
            <Text>Defense comes second to growth.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1270D_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>An Admiral's Worth</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>As envious neighbors set their sights on the {1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} coasts, Yi Sun-sin evaluates the fleet. Sound vessels are only one part of a successful navy; its admirals too must be disciplined leaders. Such men are few and valuable.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>An Admiral's Worth</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271B_NAME">
            <Text>Reward the best with a rare commendation.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>A steadfast admiral is worth more than one hundred ships.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Have a Fleet Commander with a Commendation.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271C_NAME">
            <Text>The sea will sort the cowards from the brave.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1271C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} Naval Units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>The Tiger's Tail</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Yi Sun-sin's sailors have mapped the sea against the stars. Yet the rocky coasts have no reflection in the sky, and shoals do not distinguish between friend and foe.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>The Tiger's Tail</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272B_NAME">
            <Text>With more study, we can further our advantage.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The coasts are a harbor for the fleet and a snare for enemies.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Research Navigation Mastery and Build a Lighthouse.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272C_NAME">
            <Text>The cape is a familiar face to {1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} sailors.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1272C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10135A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>An Element of Choice</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10135A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>A hostile neighbor is making a mockery of {1_civilization_adj} borders. The troops are eager to march, but Admiral Yi must choose the gate of their departure to ensure success of the mission. West, the element of metal, represents destruction; east, the element of wood, signifies cooperation.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10135B_NAME">
            <Text>West. This is a mission of force.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10135B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10135C_NAME">
            <Text>East. Collaboration will reap rewards.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10135C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>+25% [icon:YIELD_DIPLOMACY] Influence to "Befriend Independent" Diplomatic actions.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10136A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>A Test of Trust</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10136A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Gossip about a captain’s misbehavior is on everyone’s lips in Yi Sun-sin’s court. A peer has accused the captain of disobeying the admiral’s orders for a full assault, but the captain defends his choice to harry instead. He claims the orders would have led his men straight into an ambush.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10136B_NAME">
            <Text>Trust the captain’s judgment.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10136B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}, but {2_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10136C_NAME">
            <Text>The state cannot tolerate disobedience.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10136C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}, but Fleet Commander is returned to Owned Territory.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1273A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Beyond the Horizon</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1273A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Yi Sun-sin looks out across the dark waves to the distant horizon. What lies beyond the familiar shores? Perhaps it is time to brave the depths.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1273B_NAME">
            <Text>The fleet chafes for new challenges.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1273B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Story continues.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1273C_NAME">
            <Text>New horizons excite the curiosity of {1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} scholars.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1273C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Story continues.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Every Fathom a Prize</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Lately, the seas swarm with enemy warships escorting convoys of valuable resources. Yi Sun-sin's fleet stands ready to claim this treasure, for the seas belong to the bold.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Every Fathom a Prize</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274B_NAME">
            <Text>{1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} ships will hunt like tigers.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The sea itself is a treasure worth protecting.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Return a Captured Treasure Convoy.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274C_NAME">
            <Text>Generosity leads to prosperity.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1274C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1275A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Patience to Counter Greed</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1275A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The avarice of others is a constant menace, but Yi Sun-sin is never caught unawares. While neighbors vie for dominance, he sets his sights on treasure afar. The admirals must be ready to press ahead.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1275B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Patience to Counter Greed</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1275B_NAME">
            <Text>The path of duty demands action.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1275B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} on Naval Units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1275B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>A disciplined admiral knows when to seize the advantage.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1275B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Have a Fleet Commander with 2 Commendations.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Curiosity Knows No Limits</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Young scholars walk the streets of {1_capital}, filling the air with questions and curiosity. Their ideas are promising, but Yi Sun-sin recognizes that true progress requires diverse perspectives.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Curiosity Knows No Limits</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276B_NAME">
            <Text>Attract more scholars to expand the nexus of learning.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Broadened minds devise cunning strategies.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Place 2 more Specialists in {1_capital}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276C_NAME">
            <Text>The mind may be nimble, but might wins in the end.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1276C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} Infantry Units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1277A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Explorers of Inquiry</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1277A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>{1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} scholars are among the first to step foot on distant shores. New materials spur invention, and newly-met neighbors exchange fresh ideas. Yi Sun-sin sees the potential of this developing frontier.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1277B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Explorers of Inquiry</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1277B_NAME">
            <Text>Cultivate a hub of learning amidst the new environs.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1277B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Enter a Celebration.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1277B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The quest for new knowledge benefits {1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} society at home and abroad.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1277B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Have 3 Specialists in Distant Lands.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10137A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>A Golden Fan</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10137A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>A lacquered box, found in the captain’s quarters of the enemy’s ship, contains a golden fan. It bears the name of their leader, Toyotomi Hideyoshi. A gift, perhaps. Yi Sun-sin scoffs at the extravagant and useless trinket.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10137B_NAME">
            <Text>Toss it into the sea.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10137B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10137C_NAME">
            <Text>Donate it to a temple.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10137C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10138A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Just a Number</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10138A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The enemy’s fleet vastly outnumbers Yi Sun-sin’s own force, yet his clever strategies have given him a foothold. Now to set the trap.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10138B_NAME">
            <Text>Feint a retreat to draw them out.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10138B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} on Naval Units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10138C_NAME">
            <Text>Choke their supply lines.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10138C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} Naval Units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10139A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Hansando</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10139A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>With a grieving heart, Yi Sun-sin returns to his base, one less comrade to share the evening cups with. The sinking moon shines on the grim faces of his crew. Few will sleep well tonight.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10139B_NAME">
            <Text>Build a shrine to pay respects.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10139B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10139C_NAME">
            <Text>Memorialize him with an archery ground.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10139C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} to all current Commanders.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10140A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Warlord Down</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10140A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Intelligence reports tell Yi Sun-sin that this bold samurai had planned to unify the realm and steal the land of his neighbors. So much for dreams of grandeur. The promising warlord lies broken now, his arrogance a useless prop against a stronger foe.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10140B_NAME">
            <Text>Harmony is a greater goal than conquest.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10140B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10140C_NAME">
            <Text>A wise leader shows humility.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10140C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10143A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>A Standard Afloat</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10143A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>As the battle rages, Yi Sun-sin glimpses a standard floating amidst the flotsam. Quickly, he urges a sailor to haul it in. Dragged through the waves, the standard slips to reveal a face. As Yi Sun-sin had suspected, it is the enemy commander, or at least what is left of him, the standard now his shroud.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10143B_NAME">
            <Text>May he find peace under the waves.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10143B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} to all current Commanders.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10143C_NAME">
            <Text>Hang him from the mast.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10143C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} on Naval Units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>From Sea to Sky</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>No longer are the seas solely ruled by ships – vessels of the sky now too hold sway. Duty demands an answer, and Yi Sun-sin is prepared.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>From Sea to Sky</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278B_NAME">
            <Text>Bridge the sea and the sky to ensure a safe border.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_child_reward}</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Across sea and sky, the path of duty leads ever onward.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Have an Aircraft Carrier with a Commendation.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278C_NAME">
            <Text>Close.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278D_NAME">
            <Text>Close.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1278D_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} and enter a Celebration.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>A Limitless Frontier</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>{1_CIVILIZATION_ADJ} scientists announce to Yi Sun-sin that they have harnessed lightning. What limit can there be to knowledge when the sky is bottled in a bulb? The very air is thick with possibility.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279B_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>A Limitless Frontier</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279B_NAME">
            <Text>The night awash in light is just the beginning.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_child_reward}</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279B_COMPLETION">
            <Text>The frontier of knowledge climbs ever higher.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279B_IMPERATIVE">
            <Text>Have 5 Laboratories.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279C_NAME">
            <Text>Close.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279D_NAME">
            <Text>Close.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_CHAIN_1279D_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward} and enter a Celebration.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10141A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>A Clever Turtle</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10141A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>As the enemy’s turtle ship sinks beneath the waves, Yi Sun-sin marvels at the design. Truly, some genius must have invented such a vessel, able to bombard and maneuver while deftly fending off enemy fire. Perhaps the {1_civilization_adj} engineers could develop a counter.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10141B_NAME">
            <Text>Develop a schematic with the engineers.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10141B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10141C_NAME">
            <Text>Our fleet is already more than capable.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10141C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>An Ailing Mother</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Late in the afternoon, a patrol ship brings messages from the mainland. One weathered soldier gasps at the bad news - his long-sick mother has passed. In Yi Sun-sin’s cabin, he requests a leave of absence, pressing on his duty to family.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142B_NAME">
            <Text>Allow him time to grieve.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}, but {2_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142C_NAME">
            <Text>His duty is with his troops.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}, but {2_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142D_NAME">
            <Text>Xiao is the most important virtue.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10142D_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144A_STORYTITLE">
            <Text>Kyujanggak</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144A_COMPLETION">
            <Text>Confucian scholarship and Joseon history combine amidst the beauty of the city’s monuments. Inspired by the sights, Yi Sun-sin declares the foundation of Kyujanggak, a place to preserve and spread the knowledge of Joseon excellence.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144B_NAME">
            <Text>Confucian ideals will be known to all.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144B_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}, but {2_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144C_NAME">
            <Text>Science is the key to our future.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144C_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}, but {2_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144D_NAME">
            <Text>Tourists will spur the economy.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_10144D_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>{1_reward}.</Text>
        </Row>
    </EnglishText>
</Database>
